  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Changing `EncFrostbiteSpider` 023AAA also needs `MQ101FrostbiteSpider` 109C1C (Helgen, level 1): it uses 023AAA as its template but not for `Stats`. The snow spider `EncFrostbiteSpiderSnow` (a row above, 3) does the same.",
      "Changing `EncFrostbiteSpiderLarge` 041FB4 also needs `MQ101FrostbiteSpiderLarge` 109C1D (Helgen, level 1): same pattern. `EncFrostbiteSpiderSnowLarge` (a row above, 8) does the same.",
      "Changing `EncFrostbiteSpiderGiant` 023AAB does not change `EncFrostbiteSpiderSnowGiant` (17) or `DLC1VQ01GiantSpider` (both rows above): they use 023AAB as their template but not for `Stats`. `MS13FrostbiteSpider` (a row) does the same with `EncFrostbiteSpiderGiantAmbush` 02A1DC.",
      "Lis (`DBLis` 0A19FE, `DBLisDead` 0A19FF) is a Frostbite Spider (`FrostbiteSpiderRace`) with no template and level 1; she is on Factions → Dark Brotherhood → *Named Dark Brotherhood*.",
      "Every other spider record (the `Ambush`, `dunHarmugstahl`, `dunHonningbrew`, `dunChillwind`, `dunFellglow`, `E3Demo`, `DLC1VC` variants and every `Lvl*FrostbiteSpider*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
